    en: { title: 'Cosmetic surgery abroad: reported incidents, complaints and closures per clinic', h1: 'Reported incidents, complaints and closures at clinics abroad', lead: n => `This overview lists the ${n} cases we found while checking the clinics and doctors in our rankings: a death, an open complaint, or a service closed by a regulator. Each line links to its source and says where the matter stands. A complaint is not a ruling.`, cols: ['Provider', 'Country', 'What is reported', 'Source'], what: 'What is on this list and what is not', whatP: 'We include a case only when a news organisation or regulator names the provider. The list is not complete: most complications are never reported, and a provider without an entry has not been cleared by us. A provider with a serious open incident gets no numbered place in our ranking.', how: 'How to use it', howP: 'Ask the provider about any case listed here, ask which hospital handles complications, and check the doctor in the national register before you pay a deposit.' },
